                                                "text": "Activities include: / Music and Dancing / Speeches / An attempt to bring Tory and WBM to the East Coast / Balloons / Om nom noms / […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44e21e6b-47eb-42dd-9966-57a74617f92b",
